SOAPBOX: Thank you all organisers and participants. The rules and FAQs for this contest are really well written and comprehensive - thank you.
SOAPBOX: Running 80W fron SunSDR2Dx to a 22m wire doublet 8m high. Windows 11 laptop with WSJT-x latest beta.
SOAPBOX: All bands 10-40m performed well here especially the last 12 hours. 80m was completely dead.
SOAPBOX: My strategy was to keep moving bands to collect multipliers and then work as many NA stations as possible (5/6 points each from VK). Seemed to work well as I hit over double my target.
SOAPBOX: Looking forward to next year. 73.
